### KampusCare Backend API Test Collection (VS Code REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check (T02)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Login Berhasil (T03)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mahasiswa@kampuscare.ac.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Ambil token dari respons login di atas
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Login Gagal - Email Salah (T04)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "salah@kampuscare.ac.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Login Gagal - Password Salah (T05)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mahasiswa@kampuscare.ac.id",
  "password": "passwordsalah"
}

### 5. Login Gagal - Body Kosong (T06)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. GET Rooms - Token Valid (T07, T13, T14)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. GET Rooms - Tanpa Header Authorization (T08)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms

### 8. GET Rooms - Token Invalid / Random (T09)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer token_acak_yang_tidak_valid_12345

### 9. GET Current User / Me - Token Valid (T11, T17)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. GET Current User / Me - Tanpa Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 11. Logout - Token Valid (T12)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Logout - Tanpa Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

### 13. GET Rooms - Token yang Sama Setelah Logout Harus Ditolak
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
